Mark Hamzy replied about co-locating an FSG Open Printing
meeting with LinuxWorld in New York City (20-23 January 2004).
Which is probably a good idea (though way too soon to plan).

The PWG officially asked the FSG this morning (during our WBMM
day-long teleconference about a joint PWG/FSG meeting.  The
PWG 2004 schedule will be discussed TOMORROW morning at the
PWG plenary.

Therefore, please send comments TODAY.

